    "title": "Cameras capture two men breaking into mailboxes Friday after months of thefts. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karina Hollingsworth ,\n1 days ago SAN ANTONIO - Residents in the Fieldstone subdivision are frustrated. They say thieves have been breaking into their mailboxes and steal packages for over 8 months. Juan Marquez, a board member of the neighborhood’s HOA says they installed cameras to catch the thieves. The cameras slowed the break-ins, but not for long. Read full article\n8",
